---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import CorrectionReport from '../components/CorrectionReport.astro';
import {pageMetadata as m} from '../config/pages.js';
---
<BaseLayout {...m.workspace} breadcrumbs={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Workspace',href:'/workspace/'}]}>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="WORKSPACE · AVAILABLE" title="Privacy-first local continuity" description="Favorite tools, revisit recent tools, and explicitly save portable workspaces in this browser—without an account or cloud sync." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container workspace-grid">
    <section class="workspace-panel"><div class="workspace-summary-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">FAVORITES</span><div data-favorite-list><p class="muted">No favorites yet.</p></div></div><div><span class="eyebrow">RECENT TOOLS</span><div data-recent-list><p class="muted">No recent tools yet.</p></div></div></div><span class="eyebrow">SAVED WORKSPACES</span><h2>Your local workspaces (<span data-workspace-count>0</span>)</h2><p class="muted">No raw DevOps input is stored automatically. Saved data may disappear if browser data is cleared or evicted.</p><div data-workspace-list><p class="muted">Loading local workspace summaries…</p></div></section>
    <aside class="workspace-panel"><span class="eyebrow">LOCAL DATA & PRIVACY</span><h2>You stay in control</h2><ul><li>Favorites and recent tool IDs use small browser preferences.</li><li>Workspace content uses IndexedDB only after explicit save.</li><li>No account, cloud sync, analytics, or server upload.</li><li>Sensitive-content warnings are helpful but incomplete.</li></ul><div class="preference-controls"><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-toggle="rememberFavorites" checked/> Remember favorite tools</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-toggle="rememberRecentTools" checked/> Remember recently opened tools</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-preference-toggle="workspaceEnabled" checked/> Enable saved workspaces</label></div><div class="workspace-controls"><button class="button secondary" data-export-all>Export all workspaces</button><label for="import-mode">Import behavior</label><select id="import-mode" data-import-mode><option value="merge">Merge safely</option><option value="replace">Replace after validation</option></select><label class="button ghost file-button" for="workspace-import">Choose workspace JSON</label><input id="workspace-import" data-import-file type="file" accept="application/json,.json"/><button class="button ghost" data-request-persistence>Ask browser to protect saved data</button><button class="button ghost" data-clear-recent>Clear recent tools</button><button class="button ghost" data-clear-favorites>Clear favorites</button><button class="button ghost danger" data-clear-all-local>Clear all local data</button></div><p class="muted" data-storage-estimate>Storage estimate unavailable.</p><p data-workspace-status aria-live="polite"></p></aside>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container status-content"><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">STORAGE LIMITS</span><h2>Local continuity is not backup</h2><p>Export important workspaces. Private browsing, browser cleanup, quota enforcement, or storage eviction may remove local data.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">STORAGE FAILURE</span><h2>Tools continue to work</h2><p>If storage is unavailable, HelpDevOps disables continuity features rather than blocking analysis, calculators, search, or references.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section correction-context"><div class="container"><CorrectionReport resourceId="/workspace/" /></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
